50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, I hear you about the burnout! But @Toshio is right, we can’t break the next treasurer. I just want a fair, simple system that works for everyone!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
